dotfiles patch over wenhao4126/dsh-herdr v0.4.0 (3cbea69). Six changes:
1. remove _dsh_herdr_pane_send_text: raw bytes into any pane's PTY, ungated
   (24 tools become 23);
2. drop the `env` parameter of workspace_create, tab_create and pane_split
   (`--env K=V` into an unsandboxed shell);
3. drop native `args` from agent_start (approval-bypass flags after `--`);
4. agent kinds claude and codex only (pi is gone; herdr 0.9.3 rejects wen
   and ocr);
5. pass the call's exec.signal to execFile, so a dsh interrupt kills herdr;
6. hand the herdr child a stripped env, never dsh's own (the model key);
plus `herdrGuard` in `inject`, so the tools stay pending unless the
dotfiles guard plugin (../herdr-guard) is mounted. Tests follow each change.

